工具和调试功能，使开发者能够更高效地构建应用。",{"type":19,"tag":43,"props":85,"children":86},{},[87,92],{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":88,"children":89},{},[90],{"type":25,"value":91},"支持最新的 Vue 3 特性",{"type":25,"value":93},": Nuxt 4 完全支持 Vue 3 的新特性，如组合式 API、Teleport 和 Suspense。",{"type":19,"tag":43,"props":95,"children":96},{},[97,102],{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":98,"children":99},{},[100],{"type":25,"value":101},"更强的性能优化",{"type":25,"value":103},": Nuxt 4 提供了多种性能优化策略，包括代码分割、懒加载和静态生成，帮助开发者构建高性能的应用。",{"type":19,"tag":43,"props":105,"children":106},{},[107,112],{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":108,"children":109},{},[110],{"type":25,"value":111},"更好的 SEO 支持",{"type":25,"value":113},": Nuxt 4 提供了更好的 SEO 支持，包括自动生成的 meta 标签和友好的 URL 结构，帮助应用在搜索引擎中获得更好的排名。",{"type":19,"tag":43,"props":115,"children":116},{},[117,122],{"type":19,"tag":47,"props":118,"children":119},{},[120],{"type":25,"value":121},"更强的社区支持",{"type":25,"value":123},": Nuxt 4 拥有活跃的社区和丰富的插件生态系统，开发者可以轻松找到所需的资源和支持。",{"title":8,"searchDepth":125,"depth":125,"links":126},2,[127],{"id":35,"depth":125,"text":35},"markdown","content:articles:nuxt-4-guide.md","content","articles\u002Fnuxt-4-guide.md","articles\u002Fnuxt-4-guide","md",1785598913266]